// cold-start glide (the derivation refining "a degree or three" while spawn
// cascades settle, at 25%/flush pursuit = 0.25+ deg steps) and adopted jumps
// (the 66.93 deg wrong-sun event on record) both trip it; healthy steady
// churn (1-2.5 deg/s ~= 0.04 deg/flush at 60 fps) stays an order of magnitude
